  "description": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "KEDGE Business School is a French Grande École created in 2013 from the merger of EUROMED Management Marseille (founded 1872) and Bordeaux Management School BEM (founded 1874). KEDGE holds the prestigious Triple Crown accreditation — AACSB, EQUIS, AMBA — placing it among the top 1% of business schools worldwide. With 14,800 students and 8 campuses across France, China, and Africa, KEDGE is one of France's largest and most international business schools.",
      "The Paris campus, located in Boulogne-Billancourt in western Paris, hosts flagship programmes including the Programme Grande Ecole, MSc Marketing, MSc International Business, MSc Sustainable & Impact Finance, MSc Arts & Creative Industries Management, the Global MBA and Executive MBA. The Paris location provides students with proximity to the headquarters of multinational companies (LVMH, L'Oréal, Total, BNP Paribas) and an unmatched professional network.",
      "KEDGE's Master in Management has been ranked in the top 50 worldwide by the Financial Times, and MSc International Business has been ranked in the QS top 10 for International Trade. The school partners with 300 universities globally, offering dual-degree opportunities across Europe, North America, and Asia. The faculty includes 172 academics, 97% with PhDs, 46% international.",
      "International students benefit from English-taught programmes across the entire portfolio, robust career services with 76,000+ alumni in 168 countries, and the cultural richness of Paris — Europe's most-visited capital and a global hub for luxury, finance, fashion, and creative industries."
    ],
    "paragraphsRu": [
      "KEDGE Business School — французская Grande École, основанная в 2013 году в результате слияния EUROMED Management Marseille (1872) и Bordeaux Management School BEM (1874). KEDGE обладает престижной аккредитацией Triple Crown — AACSB, EQUIS, AMBA — это ставит её в топ-1% бизнес-школ мира. 14,800 студентов и 8 кампусов во Франции, Китае и Африке делают KEDGE одной из крупнейших и самых международных бизнес-школ Франции.",
      "Парижский кампус в Boulogne-Billancourt на западе Парижа — флагманские программы Programme Grande Ecole, MSc Marketing, MSc International Business, MSc Sustainable & Impact Finance, MSc Arts & Creative Industries Management, Global MBA и Executive MBA. Локация даёт прямой доступ к штаб-квартирам мультинационалов (LVMH, L'Oréal, Total, BNP Paribas) и непревзойдённый профессиональный нетворк.",
      "Master in Management KEDGE входит в топ-50 мира по Financial Times, MSc International Business — в топ-10 QS International Trade. Школа имеет партнёрства с 300 университетами, dual-degree программы по Европе, Северной Америке и Азии. Faculty — 172 преподавателя, 97% с PhD, 46% международные.",
      "Международные студенты получают англоязычные программы по всему портфолио, мощный career services с 76,000+ выпускников в 168 странах и культурное богатство Парижа — самой посещаемой европейской столицы и глобального хаба luxury, финансов, моды и креативных индустрий."
    ],
    "keyFacts": [
      "Founded 2013 (merger of EUROMED 1872 + BEM 1874)",
      "Triple Crown: AACSB + EQUIS + AMBA (top 1% worldwide)",
      "Paris campus in Boulogne-Billancourt — Programme Grande Ecole + MSc + MBA",
      "Master in Management top 50 worldwide (Financial Times)",
